 * `beforePass`, `pass`, and `afterPass`. Flattened into an `LH.Artifacts` in
 * `collectArtifacts`.
 * @typedef {Record<keyof LH.GathererArtifacts, Array<PhaseResult|Promise<PhaseResult>>>} GathererResults
